      "title": "Let's Revise",
      "type": "block",
      "items": [
        {
          "heading": "Quick revision",
          "lines": [
            "Hello! I am a pronoun. I stand in place of a noun.",
            "We use 'a' before a word that begins with a consonant sound.",
            "We use 'an' before a word that begins with a vowel sound.",
            "'A' or 'an' is used for any singular person or thing.",
            "'The' is used for a particular person, thing, place or animal."
          ],
